As I said in response to the remark you quoted, indefiniteness doesn't fix
searching, because you need a scope around the quantifier that you don't
have without an abstractor. {mi sisku da poi crino} is "There exists a
green thing for which I am searching", which means that "within the
searching" if you will there is a definite green thing.

mi'e la latro'a mu'o

